Copyright 2026 Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center

This product includes software developed by Lohit Valleru and the
HPC Engineering team at Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center.

This software was developed as part of research into AI-assisted
high-performance computing for cancer research. IrisAI is an agentic
AI system that enables cancer researchers to interact with HPC clusters
using natural language.

If you use IrisAI in your research, please cite:

  Lohit Valleru et al. "Empowering Cancer Researchers: An Agentic AI
  System for Intuitive Interaction with High-Performance Computing."
  PEARC 2026.
